print("- Memory constrained: Use {}.table() earlier (1,000 items)");
print("- Memory abundant: Use {} up to 5,000+ items");
print("");
print("Use case specific recommendations:");
print("- Configuration data: Use {} (usually < 1,000 items)");
print("- User data: Use {}.table() (likely > 1,000 items)");
